# The build context is the repository root (the image installs the run format (libs/runfile) and the duck package beside Mission Control): only what
# the Dockerfile copies goes in.
*
!control/pyproject.toml
!control/uv.lock
!control/src
!duck/pyproject.toml
!duck/src
!libs/runfile/pyproject.toml
!libs/runfile/src
**/__pycache__/
